WEBVTT

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.230
The blazing sunshine paints stark shadows on the ground.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.240
Three days into a stake-out, and the guy still hasn't shown.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.230
He's going to make me wait forever. At this rate...

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:17.390
my shadow is going to be burned into the ground.

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:23.220
I'm a bit peckish, I'll grab a bite.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.150
Hello, this is The Ark Café.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:31.630
Hey, it's me. I want a delivery. Can I get a ham & cheese sandwich, with extra lettuce?

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.650
Okay, one ham & cheese sandwich.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.640
Kanako, I just received an order for delivery.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.350
Okay, let's start making it then. Yayoi...

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.490
what is the name of the dish?

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.270
It was a ....

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.670
Oh, I forgot the name.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:52.010
Can you tell me what kind of food it is?

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.120
Yes, of course.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.560
Long time ago, a great man invented the recipe.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:03.420
Square in its shape, a vibrant pageant of a dish...

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:08.960
formed from the various colorful combinations of white, red, yellow, and green.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.370
Oh, that food sounds full of dreams!

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.570
So, do you know of such food?

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.020
Yes, of course I know.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:23.680
Hello, Ark Café here. I've brought you the delivery.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.380
Oh you're here finally. I've been waiting.

00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:29.250
Thank you for waiting. Here you go.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:34.920
...I ordered ...a ham & cheese sandwich right?

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.520
The Time Traveling Girl

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:14.780
- Anything wrong, Hideo-san?
- You don't look well.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:18.540
- I feel sluggish in the morning...
- Do you have a summer-cold?

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:22.970
- I heard morons don't catch cold.
- Oh yeah. Is it exhaustion from heat then?

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:27.050
Wait a minute. Did you just call me a moron indirectly!?

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.010
Ummm, then it's summer-stiff neck!

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.560
Arashi-san, that has nothing to do with summer...

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.780
A sudden illness of someone healthy?

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:38.550
It seems as though the illness would run away from your muscles.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:42.590
I know the cause...it's them. Them!

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:48.420
You're currently living in the mansion of those two right?

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.910
Yeah...in return...

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:54.380
those two suck my energy.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.070
- Oh yeah.
- Yayoi-san and Yamazaki-san...

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:02.440
are currently getting their energy from Murata-san.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.610
Hey. Enough with the slander.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:10.970
Why would I let Yayoi near a crude man like you?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:15.120
I'm the only one taking your energy.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:19.030
- Huh? Really?
- Then, who's giving Yayoi-san the energy?

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:23.210
Of course! I'm giving Yayoi the energy.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:25.090
The end result is the same!!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:29.540
Because they suck my energy dry, I'm exhausted lately.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.620
I've been making mistakes on my job.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:36.330
I was supposed to investigate the husband. Instead, I found out the wife was cheating.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:40.410
I was asking around about the runaway and I asked that person directly.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:43.660
When I compiled the profile, the blog had more details on it.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:47.570
I even lost running against a Chihuahua yesterday!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.190
- I can't continue working like this!
- Just because you're a big man...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.950
I suppose there's a limit to things.

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:57.800
If only we could limit the supply to one.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:02.710
Yayoi-san, I think you will need to find someone else.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:08.790
- Me!?
- Don't you have someone?

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:13.500
- It's a broad description, but a very important feeling.
- I'm sorry...not so suddenly...

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:18.790
- Is it so hard to find someone?
- Yes, not everyone is compatible.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:23.540
Hmmm, I think empathy is the key.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:27.170
Someone who shows interest in Yayoi-chan.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:31.020
Hey, wait! I don't have any interest in HER!

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:35.610
Mister, you call that unrealized romance.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.960
YOU. You were looking at me like that?

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:45.260
- I said I have no interest in you!
- It's simply Yamazaki-san's strong spirit.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:51.540
How about we do this? From today's customers, we find someone compatible with Yayoi-chan.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:56.830
Indeed, putting it off until later won't solve anything.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.850
It's a sound idea to setup the rule and be proactive about it.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:05.990
If we can find you your energy source for the meanwhile... how about that, Yamazaki-san?

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:07.850
Alright...

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:10.710
but I won't forgive you if you find someone weird.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:14.570
Don't worry! We only have good customers here.

00:06:14.980 --> 00:06:17.150
- Ok, Yayoi-chan?
- Yes...

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:22.090
What will I do...would there be someone compatible with me?

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.370
Excuse me, sal....

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.190
Master, two kusukas please.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:33.520
- Aight. 
- A lot of people today.
- It's hot outside.

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:36.740
A good day to find someone for Yayoi-san!

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.670
Someone compatible from here...

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.780
- Thank you for waiting.
- Ah, thank you Yayoi-chan.

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.630
There's a nostalgic feel to you, Yayoi-chan.

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:57.250
Yes. Yayoi-chan, you're a lady.

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:03.180
I'm sorry. Excuse me.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:09.520
- Oh no, she's so conscious about it.
- Oh, no...

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.940
to find a compatible man...

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.220
I haven't even fallen in love...

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.720
Some feelings don't change...

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:24.390
- Hey baby. You're cute.
- T-That uniform looks good on you.

00:07:24.490 --> 00:07:29.460
- Gimme your email address.
- Eh...um...that...

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:34.550
- She's so unfriendly.
- Shouldn't you pick someone younger?

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:38.540
- Someone younger looks easier.
- Nope, on the contrary...

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:42.230
To accept  her eccentric personality...

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:45.380
you need a comforter who's older.

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:48.730
- A comforter?
- Someone stable in life who likes taking care of people.

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:52.300
An adult man full of hospitality.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:57.010
Alas, such man is hard to come by though.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.620
Stay here, Josephine.

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:05.010
...found one.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:12.430
- W...what's going on....everyone?
- Oh, nothing...

00:08:15.070 --> 00:08:17.590
Excuse me. Mind if I ask you a couple questions?

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:21.160
- Huh? Go ahead...
- Your name?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:24.530
- Yamashiro Takeshi, 26 years old.
- Your occupation?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.910
- A business man. Working for Shitamatsu Electronics.
- Your education?

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:31.600
- K University.
- History of illness? - Nothing special. - Your hobby?

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:34.470
- Taking care of dogs.
- Are you seeing anyone?

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:38.840
- Unfortunately, none.
- Perfect...

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:44.410
Hey Yamashiro-san, do you like older women?

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:49.380
- What are YOU doing?
- Exercising free love. Got a problem with that?

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.640
It's not YOUR turn right now!

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:55.970
- The chance for love is fair game...
- Come on, Yayoi-chan!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:00.310
Y-Yes... U-Um...

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:04.410
- Yes?
- A...um...

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.500
Do you like dogs?

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:11.730
Yes. I've taken care of this one since he was injured as a puppy.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:15.290
- He's liked me ever since...
- I see...

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:20.010
He's attracted to cute girls. Just like you.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.810
O-Oh...

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:26.110
Using the dog to casually tell her that she is cute!

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:30.690
- Why won't you comfort me too!
- YOU'RE not being helpful at all!!

00:09:30.890 --> 00:09:33.590
SO! What's the decision!?

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:40.030
Yes! T-That...but, um...I cannot solely make the decision based upon my feelings.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:43.470
- We have a winner!!
- How is he, Yayoi-san?

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.590
- You don't have to, if you can't!
- Just make the move!

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:50.510
- Yeah, make it or break it!
- Don't break it!

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:53.790
- Give him to me if you can't do it!
- Enough about YOU!

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:59.520
<i>What am I to do...</i>

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.640
Yayoi-chan!?

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.940
Yayoi-chan...

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:12.460
Thank you very much...indeed, when I first saw you, I felt something...

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:15.860
but I don't have the confidence!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.670
I have...lived for decades in the mansion.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:24.530
I don't have the confidence to support someone with my sickly health...

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:26.690
Yayoi...you...

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:33.060
- Do you think it's wrong...? 
- Nah. You'll be able to...support him fully...

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:39.790
- St. Bernard!
- Be careful, Yayoi!

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:49.600
- That's too much for the exhausted Shades.
- Yayoi-san, run away!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:54.180
No! I've decided. I will accept it!

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:00.750
She stopped it!?

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.890
- Did she...
- Compatible with the dog?

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:25.460
Hey everyone. My dog is outside. You should be careful.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:29.130
He has a tendency to jump on girls he finds attractive.

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.220
Why didn't you say that!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:38.620
Drawn by first sight...was that about that dog?

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.760
Yes. I don't know men yet...

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.680
but I understand his gentleness very well.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.810
Nice to meet you.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:54.770
Natsu No Arashi!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:00.440
- Ah...I've done it...
- What's up, Arashi-san?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:07.100
- The apple turned brown.
- You forgot to put it in SALT water?

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:09.320
Yes. Why don't apples turn brown...

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:12.290
when you put them into SALT water?

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:16.780
Polyphenols in the apple oxidize to make it brown.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:21.620
When you put it in SALT water, the oxidase is suppressed to keep it from turning brown.

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:25.890
Wow. You really know your science, Hajime-chan.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:31.120
Yes. I like it. Experiencing various things...

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.920
and investigating the mysteries of what you have experienced...

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:38.980
and then investigating the things which current knowledge considers impossible...

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:43.060
for the sake of progress. That's the epitome of science.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:47.010
- Wow, incredible.
- You're such a science-nerd.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:52.650
How did such a science-nerd come to accept Arashi?

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:56.120
- What?
- 'Cuz ghosts aren't scientific.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:02.240
Hmph. That's because, the day I met Arashi-san...

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:05.300
I had an ultra-extreme love-leading experience.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:09.760
- What? - WHAT!? - Hey Arashi, is that true?

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:13.860
Tell them, Arashi! If it weren't for the DOINGS of that time...

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.600
we wouldn't be here today.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.240
- DOINGS!?
- What was it about...?

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:26.570
N-No, Hajime-chan, it's embarrassing.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:30.430
Hey, what is it, what is it, I want to know, tell me!

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:34.220
Ugh, I can't tell you that, Master.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.470
Right, Arashi?

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:41.740
- I don't remember a thing...
- As I've suspected.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:44.350
- What shall I do?
- Why should I care?

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.660
But you saw Hajime-chan's face, right?

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.500
His glasses were glittering.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:53.910
Can't you tell him the truth and ask him?

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.380
It was the moment Hajime-chan opened up to me.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.420
If he finds out that I don't remember...

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:03.050
he'll be shocked and our relationship will be in danger

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.020
I won't be able to fly anymore.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.540
You really don't remember anything?

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:13.050
I see. You mean you two were DOING IT until you lost consciousness....

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:17.350
WHAAAT!! SCANDALOUS! Completely scandalous!

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:22.320
- Yayoi?
 - W-W-W-What shall I do! Did I really DO it!?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.850
- Don't ask me.
- Is there a way to ask Yasaka...

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.240
without him knowing it?

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:32.320
- It's not impossible...
- Really!? What should I do!?

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:36.140
Alright, but it's a bit dangerous.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.360
Hajime-chan...I'm sorry.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:51.400
But...this is the only way left...

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:58.700
I'm coming Hajime-chan.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.980
The day Hajime-chan and I met.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.200
Junior high kids do sleep a lot.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:26.410
Alright! Now's the time to find out about stuff.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:34.280
If I recall, I was in the bath this day...

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:43.420
I need to be careful not to meet myself...

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:47.050
Alright, I wonder where Hajime-chan went.

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:49.570
I hope I'll be able to ask without raising suspicion.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:54.090
What is she...

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:58.580
Because... I'm a ghost and I'm possessing you.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:03.520
She's SO going to haunt me! What will become of me!?

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:07.310
A ghost? Such an unscientific existence.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:12.850
But... that view of the past...how would I explain that?

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.850
Hypnosis? Or is that a hologram?

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.460
Neither of them is realistic.

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:22.410
Is there a more scientific reason...? Right!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.920
Let's theorize that there's an undiscovered black hole...

00:16:27.950 --> 00:16:30.310
30 light years away from our solar system...

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:36.170
and the light from earth is bent by the gravity of the black hole...

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:38.880
and reflected back...

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:41.870
it'll take 60 years for the round trip.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:45.410
That would make the vision of the past possible!!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.240
When that happened, coincidentally...

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:52.260
the images were displayed to my retina!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.430
Right! This is a space-level gravity mirage!!

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:00.030
Phew. I have experienced something TREMENDOUS.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:03.250
I'll need to write a thesis and present this to the scientific society.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:07.800
My free-research for the summer is set!!

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:13.310
She jumped 10 meters easily.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.730
Impossible for an ordinary person...

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:19.750
is she a ghost...? No! That's too unscientific!!

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:23.820
I'll need to inspect this scientifically. If she's a human...

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.900
she can't jump 10 meters. The possible solutions are...

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:33.060
Right! It can be explained if I actually fell 10 meters.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:36.850
There's a hole 10 meters deep--if I fell in there...

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:40.710
it would seem as if she jumped 10 meters.

00:17:40.710 --> 00:17:45.290
Other minor details of the memory are lost during the shock of the fall!

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:49.660
Yes, that explains it! See, it's scientific!

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:53.190
I'd die if I fell 10 meters...

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.410
Where is Hajime-chan?

00:17:57.140 --> 00:17:59.150
Right!

00:17:59.250 --> 00:18:02.180
Hajime-chan, help me out a little.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.680
This way!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.680
This way...

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:12.910
- Here!
- Make the hole 5 meters...

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:17.530
and she jumped 5 meters. That's a total of 10 meters.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:22.240
It's more realistic than jumping or falling 10 meters.

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:24.600
Yes, it must be this.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:27.210
Phew. This is a unique experience too.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:30.490
I think I should write a thesis and present this to the scientific society too.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.760
I'll make this a candidate for the free-research for the summer.

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:38.040
Now, everything is scientifically explained.

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:40.210
There is nothing to fear...

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:47.790
W-Wait Hajime-chan!

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:52.630
I want to ask you something. Please listen to me, Hajime-chan.

00:18:57.060 --> 00:19:01.040
After I came back, did I do something to you?

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:07.830
- Nooo!!! Ghost in here too!!
- How rude!!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:12.700
What is up with HER. She's haunting me all over.

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:20.240
Hey hey, just listen to me, Mr. Yasaka!

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.510
Don't follow me!

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:27.350
Hey! I just want to ask you something...I'm getting angry now.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:33.020
A ghost? NOWAY! Impossible! Just an illusion! Exhaustion!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.920
If this is a dream, wake  ME up!!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:39.300
Hey, Hajime! Listen!

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:43.630
Doesn't a scientist accept what he has witnessed?

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:49.330
Experiencing various things, investigate the mysteries of what you have experienced.

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:55.100
- That is science. Isn't that the correct way of looking at the world?
- H-How do you know my theory!

00:19:55.100 --> 00:20:00.870
The future you said it. That there is progress in investigating the impossible.

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.510
Feel it, here!

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:22.530
- Did you feel it a bit?
- ...soft.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:27.870
Yeah...I felt it...

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:30.810
Tsk. There's no other explanation.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:34.690
What I felt today was real...

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:37.940
I guess ...I'll need to accept that fact.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.090
Good, Hajime-chan.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.970
- So Hajime-chan, I want to ask you something...

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.590
Indeed the opportunity was an accident, but...

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:51.830
- ...nothing can stop my feelings.
- Huh?

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.950
- That fact that we two are here is indeed a reality! 
- Eh?

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:59.570
- I don't care whoever you are. 
- Hajime-chan...

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:01.960
- This is destiny right?
- Hey!

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:05.780
Arashi-san, I've fallen in love with you!!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:12.310
Just so, I haven't admitted that you're a ghost ok?

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:15.150
Why! I just jumped that high!

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.250
That's just brute strength!!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:21.620
You can't jump that high just with brute strength! Mine's the power of a ghost.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:25.950
- Ghosts don't exist.
- We traveled back in time together.

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:30.310
- That's a gravitational mirage caused by the black hole.
- What is that!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:34.840
Listen Arashi-san. I don't care what you are.

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:39.170
I've fallen in love with you. That is my truth.

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:46.560
Ah, what? Just a hug.

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:50.670
Since you mentioned DOING it, I thought it was something more NAUGHTY.

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:54.300
I-It's NAUGHTY enough, Arashiyama-senpai.

00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:56.560
Very pure indeed.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:59.360
Just like the boys in our age...

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.610
Such a trouble maker. But...

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:08.280
he doesn't know the truth yet right?

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:11.880
<i>Liking someone just because of that...that's sad...</i>

00:22:14.210 --> 00:22:18.220
Oh Arashi-san. I thought you wanted to ask me something?

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:21.630
Sure thing, I'll tell you. Just ask me anything.

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:25.580
- It's fine now.
- Huh, why?

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:28.990
I've already found out.

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:32.980
- Speaking of ghosts...
- You mean us?

00:23:32.980 --> 00:23:38.240
We hear the etiquette for ghosts in Japan is to wear a triangular bandage on their heads and be transparent below the waist.

00:23:38.370 --> 00:23:40.710
Maybe we're breaking the rules.

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:42.200
That's not "etiquette."

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:44.200
See you bright and early tomorrow!
